  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Liquation method is used when the melting point of metal is less compare to the melting point of the associated impurity.</p><p>In liquation process, the impure metal is heated on slopy hearth of furnace, due to less melting point, metal melts first and flow down leaving impurities behind.</p>",
